      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To handle the OAuth callback and exchange an authorization code for tokens, I will use the Google OAuth2 provider as an example. I will create the file `oauth_callback.py` with the necessary code to perform the token exchange using the Google provider. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887815390,
          "start": 1789887812260
